    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exceptional commercial and residential landmark in the heart of the heritage town of Listowel town.  This pivotal three-story property, formerly Carmody’s Off-Licence, occupies a high-profile corner position at the bustling intersection of William Street and Charles Street. Spanning approximately 210 sqm, the prominent building delivers a versatile dual-income profile or a premium live-work configuration. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a prime retail unit with generous window display maximizing exposure to Listowel's highest volumes of vehicular traffic and pedestrian footfall. Overhead, across two levels, sits expansive residential living space configuration for 5/6 bedrooms, benefiting from independent street access. Offering immense redevelopment potential, this town-centre gem represents a rare, high-yielding investment opportunity in a thriving market town.  Viewing is highly advised - Contact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers on 068 21739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall & Staircase - 5.0m x 1.2m \r\nFitted carpet, access from William Street.\n\r\n\r\nLounge - 3.7m x 2.5m \r\nLarge window overlooking William Street, built-in display cabinets and wood flooring.  \r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.3m x 4.1m \r\nWood flooring, fitted kitchen with electric hob and overhead extractor oil boiler\r\n\r\nInternal Lobby - 2.6m x 1.0m \r\nTiled floor.\n\r\n\r\nUtility/Scullery - 3.5m x 3.1m \r\nTiled floor, fitted units, stainless steel sink, plumbed for appliances, wc, whb and rear door access to internal court yard. \r\n\r\nCourtyard - 2.7m x 3.6m \r\nCanopy, oil tank, electricity and concrete floor.\r\n\r\nFormer Commercial Space - 7.3m x 5.5m \r\nWith access points onto both Charles Street and William Street, a large display window facing onto William Street, dual aspect, vinyl and carpet flooring, built-in display cabinets. \r\n\r\nLanding Second Floor - 1.6m x 3.7m \r\nFitted carpet, built in storage and staircase to third floor\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.6m x 4.5m \r\nFitted units, solid fuel fireplace, large window overlooking William Street. \n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 4.0m \r\nDual aspect, fitted carpet, over looking Charles Street and William Street.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 4.5m \r\nFitted carpet, built-in floor to ceiling wardrobes - overlooking Charles Street.\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.6m x 2.6m \r\nFitted units, wc, whb, bidet, bath and fire exit door. \r\n\r\nLanding Third Floor - 2.5m x 3.5m \r\nFitted carpet - rear window.\r\n\r\nShower room - 2.2m x 1.2m \r\nVinyl flooring, wc, whb, shower.\r\n\r\nLinen Press - 3.3m x 2.3m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.9m x 3.6m \r\nFitted carpet, overlooking Charles Street and upper William Street, built-in wardrobes and whb.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.8m x 3.6m \r\nFitted carpet - dual aspect.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 - 2.7m x 4.4m \r\nFitted carpet, overlooking William Street and solid fuel fireplace . \r\n\r\n"
      },
